### 6. No CORS Configuration (OWASP A05:2021 – Security Misconfiguration)

**Problem:** No CORS policy is defined. By default Express doesn't set CORS headers (so browsers block cross-origin requests), but this should be explicitly configured to avoid accidentally permissive settings later.

